# LF everywhere, in the repo and in the working copy on every platform.
#
# Not just a tidiness preference: Prettier's default endOfLine is "lf", and CI
# runs on Linux and macOS as well as Windows. Left to Git's native checkout,
# a Windows clone would get CRLF working files that Prettier then wants to
# rewrite, and the next commit from that machine would rewrite every line of
# every file it touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated, and not worth reading in a diff or counting as authored code.
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated

# glTF is JSON, so Git will happily diff it -- 700 KB of mesh coordinates that
# no reviewer wants inline. Treat the models as the assets they are.
*.gltf -diff linguist-vendored
